# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# V1 suite — ignore rules
#
# Patterns are deliberately written WITHOUT a leading path (e.g. `conf/` not
# `TradeBoard/conf/`) so they match at any depth. Apps move between folders as
# the suite grows; a path-anchored rule would silently stop protecting a secret
# the moment its app was relocated.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Secrets — NEVER commit these ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# `**/` prefixes are REQUIRED: a pattern containing a slash (e.g. `conf/*.txt`)
# is anchored to the repo root, so it would NOT match TradeBoard/conf/token.txt.
**/conf/token.txt
**/conf/*.txt
**/webull_config.json
**/webull_raw_sample.json
**/broker_import.json
**/broker_positions.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.secret
# Wrangler local secret files (Plaid keys etc. during `wrangler dev`)
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
!.dev.vars.example

# ── Broker / sync runtime output ─────────────────────────────────────────────
webull_trade_sdk.log*
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated by `npm run build`; the deploy workflow rebuilds it in CI before
# deploying workers/site, so it never needs to be committed.
dist/
# Superseded per-app build output (the suite-level dist/ replaced it).
**/public/index.html
**/public/_headers
# Stale copy of tradeboard.html from before the suite build existed. The
# canonical source is TradeBoard/tradeboard.html.
TradeBoard/index.html

# ── Firebase / deploy local caches ───────────────────────────────────────────
.firebase/
firebase-debug.log

# ── Node / Cloudflare Workers ────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.wrangler/

# ── Desktop shell (Tauri) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Rust build output is enormous (a debug binary alone is ~220 MB).
target/
# Generated by `npm run build:desktop` — a copy of tradeboard.html.
**/desktop/dist/
# Tauri codegen output.
**/desktop/src-tauri/gen/

# ── Editor / OS cruft ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json

# ── Reference-only (friend's apps — never publish) ───────────────────────────
# Insight/TradeHub are FUNCTIONAL REFERENCES ONLY. They contain someone else's
# Firebase project, Plaid deployment and Formspree form; publishing them would
# expose another person's infrastructure.
tradehub.html
insight.html
tradeboard.applock-ref.html
*.reference.html
